<title>POLAND: AMERBANK IN $22 MLN BANK CONSORTIUM.</title>
<headline>AMERBANK IN $22 MLN BANK CONSORTIUM.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Amerbank is in a consortium to lend Polish shipyard Stocznia Gdynia SA a loan of $22 million, the bank said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bank said the consortium also includes state-owned Bank Zachodni, Kredyt Bank , Polski Bank Inwestycyjny, BPH and BOS .</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
